  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Drafted one class-22 pure-logic component pc-contrast-04: it reads raw slots via inputs.get('slots') so absence is a valid outcome, validates that slots is a list of length 0..3 with every item an exact integer in 4..8 (rejecting bool, float, non-integers and out-of-range values), and assigns result = {'ok': valid, 'slots': original if valid else []} at module scope with no I/O, imports, host calls or exceptions. The draft is an unapproved target-interface component only; activation requires Q1/human Q2 and typed-runner support, which remain separate prerequisites.",
